4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2gPdFZDCg3wQ7kNvwEM2GFF&_nc_oc=AdpKITM-ZQcKng6yT-fE-Hz-1UKZkWUeoBtjg8StcQ6yGz8sd_2faU2Wfb4iett8QF0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBs4JxOIMIg3KZmgDvEgUOC39fUcMTBE3sX6t-SdUjKCQ&oe=6A6F4054"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o1umpV353R0Q7kNvwGurn7p&_nc_oc=Adq_zDag14NYutEQ0ZuF2lNJLspPQNR5syGXnkEt18rTNB70voYKyT2jT8mh2_keWkM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAjSxr0oMswn34eZWs8uZl064ZfSuSQjj_V5ISWKd20Mg&oe=6A6F4532"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f8vsdDfwEcwQ7kNvwHFDkM-&_nc_oc=AdoxY5lwl0ivdIzzlN6b6ZUDK8QN8LRoB6Q75wwL-Ipvj0cNSjBHkna8tJgl2h50z00&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCf2mTd3sxL_ns3ZeikXOGL9Cgsn-lAZ09zbYX1eybfgQ&oe=6A6F52D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p